---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Privacy Policy | Duke's Professional Cleaning"
  description="Privacy Policy for Duke's Professional Cleaning Services LLC. Explaining how we collect, use, and protect your information."
>
  <main>
    <section class="policy-shell">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: July 5, 2026</p>
      <p>
        Duke's Professional Cleaning Services LLC respects your privacy. This
        policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and what
        choices you have.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Contact details you submit in quote or RFP forms</li>
        <li>Business and facility information relevant to service requests</li>
        <li>Basic technical data such as browser type and pages visited</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to inquiries and prepare estimates or proposals</li>
        <li>Schedule, deliver, and support requested services</li>
        <li>Improve website usability and service communication</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell your personal information. Data may be shared with service
        providers that help us operate this website or deliver services, under
        reasonable confidentiality protections.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain information for as long as needed to respond to requests,
        deliver services, and meet legal or operational obligations.
      </p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>
        We use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards. No method of
        transmission or storage is guaranteed to be fully secure.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Request updates or corrections to submitted information</li>
        <li>Request deletion where legally permitted</li>
        <li>Opt out of non-essential follow-up communications</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy questions, contact Duke's Professional Cleaning Services LLC
        at <a href="mailto:ddelisfortservices@gmail.com">ddelisfortservices@gmail.com</a>
        or <a href="tel:+16786222895">(678) 622-2895</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
